            "review_text": "Hải\nDa Nang, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nNgon ha noi\nJan 2020\nOliverLys Leung Local guide · 59 value Very nice location, good food from Hanoi, good atmosphere where you feel at home, great service and welcoming staff and owners property. It was a new restaurant for about 7 months and the owners were from Hanoi. The place is clean and the food is good for the price. 2 Waiters serving tonight is too good. I appreciate Bun Bun there, it's very good, preferably Hanoi .. This is my own experience, some may be like other things .. But all I can say, you won't disappointed with all. Owners make you feel at home, but perhaps in peak times they won't have time to chat with all Clients, but it's a positive move from them .. We will come back ...\nRead more\nWritten January 17, 2020",
